  "description": "<div>\n<p>Are you an AI Engineer passionate about building and deploying scalable AI solutions in real-world environments?</p>\n<p>At Company 8a00f8c1beb9, we're looking for experienced AI Engineers to help enterprise organizations develop, deploy, and scale innovative AI applications and platforms.</p>\n<p>We're looking for professionals with strong hands-on experience in AI engineering, solid software development skills, and expertise in Azure cloud technologies. Experience with Generative AI, LLMs, and cloud-native AI solutions is highly valued.</p>\n<p>Whether your expertise lies in AI application development, Generative AI, or AI platform engineering, you'll have the opportunity to work on challenging projects using modern AI and cloud technologies.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"> </p>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><strong style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Why Join Us?</strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"> </span></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">At Company 8a00f8c1beb9, you’ll work on dynamic projects for industry leaders such as </span><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Heineken, ING, ASML, Philips, and Shell</strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">, tackling exciting challenges and delivering tailored enterprise solutions. </span></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Here’s what makes us stand out: </span></div>\n<div>✔ <strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Impactful Work</strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">: Shape the future of our clients’ digital landscapes. </span></div>\n<div>✔ <strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Innovative Environment</strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">: Collaborate within a supportive team that values learning and growth. </span></div>\n<div>✔ <strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">State-of-the-art technology</strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">: Access the latest tools and platforms. </span></div>\n<div>✔ <strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Global Opportunities</strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">: Dreaming of living and working in the </span><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Netherlands? </strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">We provide full support with visa processes, making your transition smooth and hassle-free! </span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">  </span></div><br><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong><br><div>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li>Design, develop, and deploy scalable AI applications and services using Python and Microsoft Azure.</li>\n<li>Build and maintain cloud-native AI solutions using Docker, Kubernetes (AKS), and CI/CD pipelines.</li>\n<li>Develop and integrate AI/ML and LLM-powered solutions with enterprise applications, APIs, and data sources.</li>\n<li>Work with Generative AI technologies, including Azure OpenAI, RAG architectures, and AI agents, depending on project requirements.</li>\n<li>Contribute to the deployment, monitoring, security, and performance optimization of AI applications in production.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with software engineers, data scientists, and platform teams to deliver reliable and scalable AI solutions.</li>\n<li>Apply software engineering best practices to ensure code quality, maintainability, and system reliability.</li>\n\n</ul></div><br><strong>Requirements</strong><br><ul type=\"disc\">\n<li>5+ years of professional experience in software engineering, AI engineering, or related technical roles, including hands-on AI/ML engineering experience.</li>\n<li>Strong Python programming skills and experience developing production-grade applications.</li>\n<li>Hands-on experience with Microsoft Azure and cloud-native application development.</li>\n<li>Practical experience with Docker and Kubernetes, preferably Azure Kubernetes Service (AKS).</li>\n<li>Experience developing, integrating, or deploying AI/ML solutions in real-world environments.</li>\n<li>Practical experience with Generative AI, LLMs, Azure OpenAI, or similar AI technologies.</li>\n<li>Experience with REST APIs, backend development, and modern software architectures.</li>\n<li>Knowledge of CI/CD pipelines and production deployment practices.</li>\n<li>Understanding of scalable, secure, and reliable cloud architectures.</li>\n<li>Experience with modern AI technologies and architectures, such as RAG, vector databases, Azure AI Search, or AI agents.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with AI deployment and operational practices, including MLOps/LLMOps, infrastructure automation, or monitoring and observability.</li>\n<li>Strong English communication skills.</li>\n\n<div>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Nice to Have</strong></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li>Experience with Agentic AI frameworks such as LangChain, LangGraph, or AutoGen.</li>\n<li>Experience with Infrastructure as Code tools such as Terraform or Bicep.</li>\n<li>Knowledge of AI security, evaluation, guardrails, and performance optimization.</li>\n\n</ul></div></ul><br><strong>What We Offer</strong><br>\n<li><strong>Competitive Compensation</strong>: Salary tailored to your skills and experience. </li>\n<li><strong>Generous Time Off</strong>: <strong>25</strong> paid vacation days (based on a 40-hour work week). </li>\n<li><strong>Relocation Support</strong>: A <strong>relocation </strong>and travel budget to ease your transition. </li>\n<li><strong>Tax Benefits</strong>: Eligibility for the <strong>30% ruling.</strong> </li>\n<li><strong>Travel Reimbursement</strong>: We've got your daily commute covered. </li>\n<li><strong>Top-Notch Equipment</strong>: A high-quality device to ensure you work efficiently. </li>\n<li><strong>Professional Development</strong>: Financial support for certifications, technical training, and language courses—because we value your long-term career growth. </li>\n<li><strong>Family</strong>: Visa sponsorship for your partner and children under 18. </li>\n<li><strong>Temporary Accommodation</strong>: Stay in temporary housing while we help you find your permanent home. </li>\n<li><strong>Comprehensive Relocation Assistance</strong>: Extensive support to help you settle in smoothly. </li>\n<li><strong>Community & Fun</strong>: Enjoy team events and connect with developers from around the globe! </li>\n<div>Join Company 8a00f8c1beb9, where your expertise will thrive, your ideas will be valued, and your career will reach new heights. </div>\n<div><strong>Apply now</strong> to be part of our transformative journey!</div><p>Find more <a href=\"https://company-4ad748b21c65.example.com/company-78e0c2a75343\">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>",
